WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Browse the wholesale rice catalog. Every active package is a 25 kg sack.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Open a rice product to see its description, texture, and cooking notes.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Choose a sack quantity and add it to your bag.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Sign in to order. Select delivery or pickup and a demonstration payment method.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
View receipts and order status in My orders. Payments and delivery movement are simulations.
